# Screenshots upload here from the admin panel.
#
# This directory rather than public/ is deliberate. Astro does not process
# anything in public/, so a photo taken on a phone would ship at full size with
# no intrinsic width or height, breaking the largest single lever against CLS
# and potentially exceeding the whole page budget in one upload.
#
# Files here go through the image() helper in src/content.config.ts, which
# converts to AVIF and WebP and infers dimensions automatically.
#
# Tracked so the folder exists in a fresh clone and Sveltia's media_folder
# resolves. Git does not track empty directories.
